{"steam_appid":1348690,"steam_name":"Oaken","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1348690/589386/77e80576aa79b79a635fdd98952c1ba848a328fd/1751225235/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1689855841","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256959245/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1689855841","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/ss_0b7add57729f169f6e6c47163dfedd032bafbb27.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727780922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/ss_ef660993da60606d5f092a2a824964a6be17ff88.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727780922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/ss_931285f69f5036c3595c0fec3c9ac167753fe8ed.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727780922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/ss_e870e8d545fddbeac53ad67325b5c097b7e56fae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727780922","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/ss_8500ad71401ce24f5fd80405a23a41b6d028cc10.1920x1080.jpg?t=1727780922"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/cbd09c97c6b12d064ca95d9f5da004f1.poster.avif?t=1727780922\" width=626 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/cbd09c97c6b12d064ca95d9f5da004f1.webm?t=1727780922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/cbd09c97c6b12d064ca95d9f5da004f1.mp4?t=1727780922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/eb3660f232f0de30ab1b1068130f9ad2.webp?t=1727780922\" width=626 height=49 /></span><br><br>The world of Oaken is a mythical place, existing in a not easily defined space and time. It is stretched among the branches of the Great Oak. Its inhabitants are spirits which listen to the same voice, called the Oak Song. The loss of that voice starts a series of events leading into a struggle which may either heal or destroy the Great Oak.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/7b9fe341af00bb438414970d28adb195.poster.avif?t=1727780922\" width=626 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/7b9fe341af00bb438414970d28adb195.webm?t=1727780922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/7b9fe341af00bb438414970d28adb195.mp4?t=1727780922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/f5a9ccc9777cb9feef5282b5af557ecb.webp?t=1727780922\" width=626 height=49 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Roguelite, hero-oriented campaign with deck management.<br></li><li>A mystical world inhabited by spirits with celtic and tribal vibes.<br></li><li>A randomly generated world map with tons of levels, bosses and events to be discovered.<br></li><li>Unique, highly tactical battles on a hexagonal grid, where position and rotation is everything.<br></li><li>Upgrade your spells and spirits the way you want.<br></li><li>Easy to learn, hard to master - chill and challenge modes suitable for any player.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1348690/extras/f7c7b612f96a82246448de888c4f18e4.avif?t=1727780922\" width=600 height=194 /></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u